{"2174060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sincognito", "steam_appid": 2174060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>PUBLIC PLAYTESTING</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and request access to the pre-alpha playtest build. Follow our Steam Community Page for updates on the next public playtest.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=69 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/1da3845bf2d159b965b33011d070cb5e.webp?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">One of the Seven Deadly Sins is haunting the castle! Work as a team to investigate, gather evidence and identify which Sin is in play before its too late!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play with <strong>1-15 players</strong> (Single-player and Multiplayer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A team member has been possessed, but which Sin is behind it? Suit up with specialist equipment to uncover clues, capture evidence, and compare findings at the Evidence Table. Once you’ve got a lead, track down the Sin’s essence and burn it in the cauldron to banish it… just don’t expect the Sin to let you do it peacefully. And if someone slips up or gets caught in the act, use what you’ve gathered to make your case and call a vote.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/c1d69e7bd4087e0b30df02a80e389707.poster.avif?t=1788127279\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/c1d69e7bd4087e0b30df02a80e389707.webm?t=1788127279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/c1d69e7bd4087e0b30df02a80e389707.mp4?t=1788127279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find the essence of the Sins’ souls lurking in areas around the map where it can be captured. Deposit the essence into a bubbling cauldron to banish the Sin you believe is in play. Be sure to keep the fire alive as Sins will aim to extinguish the cauldrons fire before their essence is destroyed.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/4b84d90cf198fa569d136ae27f57c4f0.poster.avif?t=1788127279\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/4b84d90cf198fa569d136ae27f57c4f0.webm?t=1788127279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/4b84d90cf198fa569d136ae27f57c4f0.mp4?t=1788127279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=69 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/e961a2482febff475422027bcb2d4d10.webp?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sins are able to transform between their disguised human form, and their true Sin identity. Once in their Sin form, each Sin has their own unique abilities that will facilitate different playstyles to combat the Humans and keep their Sin identity hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/d5c758c5223982d294b2f86922e1fc15.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=361 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PRIDE</strong>: Manipulates the environment and players alike, commanding others as if they were lesser beings. Ethereal and elusive, Pride is a ghostly entity with an aura of arrogance and control.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/cf83168ff942cfc9777a9b2384cb46e5.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GREED:</strong> Greed sneakily stashes items around the map into an ever-growing sack, storing up power to deliver devastating attacks. As a cursed corpse with a hunger for riches, Greed must betray and eliminate all players - including fellow Sins - to win!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/aedfb51dfb2fd479c3ccac0ad7c68079.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=342 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LUST:</strong> As a demonic marionette with a seductive twist, Lust weaves manipulation and mimicry into their gameplay. Pull unsuspecting Humans in and puppeteer their corpse to further deceive players.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/e39a3cc7bf5a2bf05e6379d3d6b224ee.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ENVY:</strong> Able to vanish briefly or mimic others to get close unnoticed, this small zombie draws near from behind in silent yearning, lashing out with a deafening scream before fleeing into the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/d0cc92d358f018a8e38efe7c2b068313.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GLUTTONY: </strong>Big, grotesque, and slow-moving, Gluttony corners prey and devours them whole - leaving no trace behind. This colossal ghoul exists purely to consume, driven by an endless, dripping hunger.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/3b390f895534c7898eb77578f2f1881e.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WRATH: </strong>Wrath is small, fast, and vicious, darting through shadows to hack and slash enemies. The more damage Wrath deals, the stronger they become. This vampiric predator thrives on fury and bloodlust, growing into a true nightmare if left unchecked.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fae7c8de09e6e03b7601147333d2c46f.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=397 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SLOTH: </strong>A sluggish but dangerous hulking behemoth. Sloth is forever burdened by heavy chains, stalking slowly, attacking only in short, sudden bursts.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Support our small indie studio - <strong>Wishlist now!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1788127279\" width=564 height=69 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/1da3845bf2d159b